Tab 1: The X-Ray Diagnostic (Default View)
Top Metric: Risk Alignment Score (e.g., "Cautious Investor holding Aggressive Growth Risk").

Interactive Sunburst Chart: Outer ring = your visible portfolio (ETFs/stocks); Inner core = what you actually own at the underlying asset level.

Thematic Cluster Graph: Nodes connected by shared revenue/economic drivers (e.g., highlighting that energy utility stocks and cloud software stocks are both tied to data center electricity demand).

Evidence Drawer (Click-to-Verify): Clicking any AI assertion slides open the underlying raw math, data freshness, and formulas used.

Tab 2: The "What-If" Sandbox (Pre-Decision Simulator)
Split-screen comparison: Current Portfolio vs. Proposed Portfolio.

