Tab 3: The Event & News Radar (Macro Context)
Portfolio-Specific Economic Calendar: Filters out noise; only displays events that matter to the user's specific factors (e.g., "FOMC Meeting: High impact due to your 35% Long-Duration Bond/Growth ETF exposure").

Headline Shock Simulator: An input box where users paste a news headline (e.g., "Taiwan Strait export restrictions announced"), and the agent breaks down the first-order, second-order, and supply-chain impacts on their specific holdings.

